│╭──────────────Notification Demo──────────────╮
││Press keys to trigger notifications:         │
││                                             │
││  s  Success notification                    │
││  e  Error with Retry action                 │
││  w  Warning notification                    │
││  i  Info notification                       │
││  u  Urgent with Ack/Snooze actions          │
││  d  Dismiss all notifications               │
